.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Raoult&#x27;s law, P_A = x_A P_A^* (~chemistrykit.thermo.systems.mixtures.raoult_vapor_pressure), makes each partial vapor pressure a straight line in liquid mole fraction. Adding the two lines (Dalton&#x27;s law) gives the total pressure, and BinaryIdealSolution computes the vapor composition, which is always richer in the more volatile component. That enrichment is the basis of fractional distillation.">

